---
import { Code } from "astro:components";
import html from "../examples/quickstart/index.html?raw";
import descriptor from "../examples/quickstart/panel.json?raw";
import app from "../examples/quickstart/main.jsx?raw";

const install = `mkdir meridian-quickstart
cd meridian-quickstart
npm init -y
npm install --save-exact \\
  @savvifi/meridian-web-react@0.25.1 \\
  @savvifi/meridian-proto-ts@0.25.1 \\
  @bufbuild/protobuf@2.12.1 \\
  react@19.2.8 react-dom@19.2.8 vite@8.3.8`;
---
<section class="quickstart" id="quickstart" aria-labelledby="quickstart-title">
  <h2 id="quickstart-title">Run the quickstart</h2>
  <p>Render a stat panel in your browser with Meridian’s React renderer and bundled HTML kit. Use Node.js 22.12 or later and npm.</p>

  <h3>1. Install the packages</h3>
  <p>This example uses the published <code>@savvifi</code> packages from npm.</p>
  <Code code={install} lang="bash" wrap />

  <h3>2. Create the descriptor</h3>
  <p>Save this Protobuf JSON as <code>panel.json</code>. The <code>stat</code> field selects the stat panel renderer.</p>
  <Code code={descriptor.trimEnd()} lang="json" wrap />

  <h3>3. Mount the panel</h3>
  <p>Create <code>index.html</code> and <code>main.jsx</code> in the same directory. The renderer decodes the descriptor and displays the value locally.</p>
  <div class="files">
    <p><code>index.html</code></p>
    <Code code={html.trimEnd()} lang="html" wrap />
    <p><code>main.jsx</code></p>
    <Code code={app.trimEnd()} lang="jsx" wrap />
  </div>

  <h3>4. Run it</h3>
  <Code code="npx vite --host 127.0.0.1" lang="bash" wrap />
  <p>Open the local URL Vite prints. You should see <strong>Deployments</strong> and <strong>42</strong>. Change the value in <code>panel.json</code> to see it update.</p>
  <a href="/features/">Explore the renderers →</a>
</section>

<style>
  .quickstart { border-top: 1px solid var(--line-2); padding: 52px 0; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: -.05em; margin: 0; }
  h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 30px 0 0; }
  p { max-width: 68ch; color: var(--muted); margin: 8px 0 12px; }
  .quickstart :global(pre.astro-code) { max-inline-size: min(100%, 76ch); overflow: auto; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 14px clamp(10px, 3vw, 16px); border: 1px solid var(--line-2); }
  code { font: .85em/1.6 var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .quickstart :global(pre.astro-code code) { font: .82rem/1.6 var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .files p { color: var(--cream); }
  a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .28em; }
</style>
